  "seoBody": "<p>A Check is a list of questions and a report layout. Build it once. Use it as often as you like.</p><h2>Parts of a Check</h2><ul><li><strong>Questions:</strong> what you answer. Text, number, photo, voice note, or yes or no.</li><li><strong>Report:</strong> the Record and its Link, written from your answers. You can download a PDF.</li><li><strong>Sends:</strong> send one now, or set a schedule. It can repeat every few days, weeks or months, on days or dates you pick. People who have not answered get a reminder.</li></ul><h2>Good questions</h2><ol><li><strong>Be direct.</strong> \"Photo of the gas meter reading\" is better than a long lead-in.</li><li><strong>Ask only what the report needs.</strong> Each extra question slows you down.</li><li><strong>Use yes or no.</strong> Pass or fail is clear.</li><li><strong>Use photos.</strong> One clear photo beats ten lines.</li></ol><h2>Editing</h2><p>Paid accounts have no limits on Checks, Records, photos or messages. Change questions any time. Records already started keep their old version. New ones use the new version.</p><h2>Voice notes</h2><p>Reply to any question with a WhatsApp voice note. Quickler writes it out and puts the words in the report.</p><p>Still stuck? Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">hello@quickler.co</a>. We reply within one business day.</p>",
